@startuml
title US-005 - Sign in - SD level 3 - Frontend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Account Holder" as User
participant "LoginPage" as View
participant "SignInForm" as Component
participant "AuthProvider" as Auth
participant "authService" as Service
participant "HttpClient" as Http
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over View, API
  Password flow only. Explicit Active-status checks, OAuth linking,\nand sign-in 401 handling in HttpClient remain open.
end note

User -> View: Submit email and password
activate View
View -> Component: handleSubmit(email, password)
activate Component
Component -> Service: signIn(email, password)
activate Service
Service -> Http: POST /auth/sign-in (SignInDto)
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> Http: 204 No Content (httpOnly session cookie set)
else Request rejected
    API --> Http: 400/401
end
deactivate API
Http --> Service: Response data or rejected request
deactivate Http
Service --> Component: Resolved, or thrown error
deactivate Service
alt Successful response
    Component -> Auth: login()
    activate Auth
    Auth --> Component: Marked signed in; anti-forgery token reset
    deactivate Auth
    Component --> View: Session started
else Failed response
    Component --> View: Error state (validation / operation failure)
end
deactivate Component
View --> User: Render the resulting state
deactivate View
@enduml
